WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:17.030
Hello, and welcome to Home Montessori Play-School, right here in Burlingame's Oak Grove Manor! I'm Miss Leah, and I'm so happy to share our sunlit Montessori home—lovingly designed for little ones ages four months to four years old.

2
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:35.494
With an intimate daily group of just four to six children, every child grows at their own natural pace. Our child-height wooden shelves invite independence across early reading, math, science, practical life, music, yoga, and English and Tagalog immersion.

3
00:00:36.294 --> 00:00:53.118
We welcome babies starting at four months old, honoring each child's personal bottle schedule, nap rhythm, and gentle potty training. Nutritious breakfasts and afternoon snacks are provided daily, while parents send their child's favorite packed lunch from home.

4
00:00:53.918 --> 00:01:11.726
We're open Monday through Friday from 8:30 AM to 4:30 PM, and we welcome in-person tours exclusively from 4:30 to 5:00 PM. Send an inquiry, book a tour, or start your child's enrollment right here on our website. I look forward to meeting your family!
